{"4942360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hailer - Driver Life of China City", "steam_appid": 4942360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4943120], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hailer - Driver Life of Dragon City - Store Page Now Live!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dragon City — a bustling metropolis inspired by Shenzhen, China. Step into the shoes of a ride-hailing driver for the &quot;SmileBoy&quot; platform, and experience the real hustle of rush hour in a 24-hour day-night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just another driving game. You'll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through gridlocked traffic and handle passengers' varied demands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the tension of morning rush hour and the calm of late-night rides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn every fare, starting from a beat-up car and working your way up to your dream vehicle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets are filled with familiar details — the street corners you almost recognize, the navigation voice you've heard a thousand times, and that passenger line: &quot;Driver, I'm in a hurry.&quot; We want to bottle that everyday life and put it right behind your steering wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A free demo is coming soon</strong> — wishlist now and be the first to know when it drops!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hailer - Driver Life of Dragon City - Store Page Now Live!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dragon City — a bustling metropolis inspired by Shenzhen, China. Step into the shoes of a ride-hailing driver for the &quot;SmileBoy&quot; platform, and experience the real hustle of rush hour in a 24-hour day-night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just another driving game. You'll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through gridlocked traffic and handle passengers' varied demands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the tension of morning rush hour and the calm of late-night rides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn every fare, starting from a beat-up car and working your way up to your dream vehicle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets are filled with familiar details — the street corners you almost recognize, the navigation voice you've heard a thousand times, and that passenger line: &quot;Driver, I'm in a hurry.&quot; We want to bottle that everyday life and put it right behind your steering wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A free demo is coming soon</strong> — wishlist now and be the first to know when it drops!</p>", "short_description": "《中国网约车模拟器》是一款以中国都市为背景的驾驶模拟游戏。你将扮演“微笑男孩”平台的网约车司机，在24小时昼夜循环中，直面真实的早晚高峰路况。从破旧轿车起步，通过接单赚钱，一步步换到梦想座驾——在充满生活烟火气的龙城里，体验方向盘后的百态人生。免费试玩版即将推出！", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942360/b03c9dbeb129240b9517c5e16c87f994e3faf652/header.jpg?t=1785800274", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942360/bd30c835a6f9c48c7cd76969c4a1000568734437/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785800274", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942360/bd30c835a6f9c48c7cd76969c4a1000568734437/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785800274", "website": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1PXTK62EHB/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=cafa7a351d578c677cd3d23692e72bf2", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIN10，WIN11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10</li></ul>", "recommended": "<st